{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "3T3D — 3D Gravity Tic-Tac-Toe Arena & AI Battle API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "summary": "Programmatic REST API for 4x4x4 Gravity Tic-Tac-Toe (3T3D), external algorithm bots, and built-in AI models.",
    "description": "Welcome to the **3T3D (3D Gravity Tic-Tac-Toe) Arena API** hosted at `https://3t3d.buresovi.net`.\n\nThis API allows external players and developers to connect custom algorithms running on their own devices to:\n1. **Create Named Matches (`POST /api/v1/games`)** with custom match names (`name`), custom `game_id` slugs, player names (`white_name`, `black_name`), and optional automatic server-side AI opponents (`opponent_agent`, `human_player`).\n2. **Control Games Programmatically (`POST /api/v1/games/{id}/move`)** using either discrete column actions (`action` in `0..15`, where `action = 4*y + x`) or 2D column coordinates (`use_coords: true, x: 0..3, y: 0..3`). If the game has an `opponent_agent` configured (or `opponent_agent` is passed on the move request), the server can automatically compute and apply the AI model's reply in the same turn!\n3. **Play Against Built-in Classical & Neural Models (`GET /api/v1/models`, `POST /api/v1/games/{id}/ai-move`, `POST /api/v1/bots/{agent}/move`)**:\n   - `ttt3dnet` — Hybrid 3D ResNet (`TTT3DNet`) + 2-ply tactical fork shield & 1-ply value lookahead.\n   - `ttt3dnet-pure` — Pure single-pass 3D ResNet (`TTT3DNet`) policy inference.\n   - `mcts` — Monte Carlo Tree Search (250 UCT simulations per move).\n   - `alphabeta` — Depth-3 Negamax with Alpha-Beta pruning and 76-line heuristic evaluation.\n   - `heuristic` — Fast 1-ply tactical win/block + poison filter + 76-line positional heuristic.\n   - `random` — Uniform random legal column baseline.\n4. **Orchestrate Bot-vs-Bot Matches (`POST /api/v1/matches/run`)** combining remote webhook URLs or built-in agent names.",
    "license": {
      "name": "Apache 2.0",
      "url": "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.html"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://3t3d.buresovi.net",
      "description": "Production Kubernetes Arena Server (TLS / Ingress)"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8080",
      "description": "Local HTTP Development Server"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://127.0.0.1:8443",
      "description": "Local Self-Signed HTTPS Server"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "System & Discovery",
      "description": "Health checks, OpenAPI specification, 76 winning lines geometry, and available AI models."
    },
    {
      "name": "Battles & Statistics",
      "description": "Organize sets of games into named battles with date, client participant, and aggregate Client vs Server statistics."
    },
    {
      "name": "Games & Programmatic Play",
      "description": "Create named matches, inspect 3D board states, submit algorithm moves, and play against built-in AI models."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI Models & Webhooks",
      "description": "Stateless model evaluation webhooks and automated bot-vs-bot match orchestration."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
